# shardcache

[![Go Report Card](https://goreportcard.com/badge/github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache)](https://goreportcard.com/report/github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache)
[![Go Reference](https://pkg.go.dev/badge/github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache.svg)](https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache)
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)

**shardcache** 是一个高性能、并发安全的 Go 内存缓存库。

它专为高并发的场景进行了极致优化，通过分片技术（Sharding）和 `sync.Pool` 对象复用来最大限度地减少锁竞争和 GC 压力。本库在并发安全和性能之间取得了极佳的平衡。

---

## 🚀 性能基准 (Performance)

本项目的设计核心是性能。以下是在一台 8 核 CPU 上的跑分数据，展示了其在高并发下的低延迟和零分配（`0 allocs/op`）特性。

**环境:**
* **CPU**: Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8650U CPU @ 1.90GHz
* **OS**: Windows
* **Arch**: amd64
* **Go**: 1.20+

**命令:** `go test -bench="^Benchmark" -benchmem`

```
goos: windows
goarch: amd64
pkg: [github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache](https://github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache)
cpu: Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8650U CPU @ 1.90GHz
BenchmarkCacheGetHit-8            28561975         42.44 ns/op        0 B/op        0 allocs/op
BenchmarkCacheGetMiss-8           24703862         48.81 ns/op        0 B/op        0 allocs/op
BenchmarkCacheSetNew-8             5599148         199.1 ns/op      111 B/op        2 allocs/op
BenchmarkCacheSetIfNotExistsNew-8    5594151         204.9 ns/op      111 B/op        2 allocs/op
BenchmarkCacheSetOverwrite-8      25967112         46.98 ns/op        0 B/op        0 allocs/op
BenchmarkCacheGetSetMixed-8       43533150         28.18 ns/op        0 B/op        0 allocs/op
PASS
ok      [github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache](https://github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache)    8.876s
```

### 跑分数据解读:

* **`BenchmarkCacheGetSetMixed` (28.18 ns/op)**: 在 90% 读/10% 写的混合高并发负载下，操作被完美分发到不同分片，平均延迟极低。
* **`BenchmarkCacheSetOverwrite` (0 allocs/op)**: 证明了 `sync.Pool` 对象复用机制工作正常，覆盖键值时无额外内存分配。

---

## 📦 安装 (Installation)

```bash
go get [github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache](https://github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache)
```

## 💡 使用 (Usage)

```go
package main

import (
	"fmt"
	"time"

    // 假设你的模块名是这个
	"[github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache](https://github.com/jamesleeon/shardcache)"
)

func main() {
	// 创建一个缓存，每 10 分钟清理一次
	c := shardcache.New(10 * time.Minute)

	// 设置一个值，TTL 为 5 分钟
	c.Set("my_key", "Hello World!", 5*time.Minute)

	// 获取一个值
	if val, found := c.Get("my_key"); found {
		fmt.Println("Found:", val) // Output: Found: Hello World!
	}

	// 等待 6 分钟
	time.Sleep(6 * time.Minute)

	// 再次获取，此时 key 应已过期
	if _, found := c.Get("my_key"); !found {
		fmt.Println("Key expired as expected.")
	}

    // 原子操作：GetOrSet
	// "key2" 不存在, computeValue 会被执行
	val, wasPresent := c.GetOrSet("key2", func() (interface{}, time.Duration) {
		return "Computed Value", time.Hour
	})
    fmt.Printf("GetOrSet: %s (wasPresent: %v)\n", val, wasPresent)

    // "key2" 已存在, computeValue 不会执行
	val, wasPresent = c.GetOrSet("key2", func() (interface{}, time.Duration) {
		// This will not run
		return "New Value", time.Hour
	})
	fmt.Printf("GetOrSet: %s (wasPresent: %v)\n", val, wasPresent)
}

```

